{1005}{}{I hand out the water rations, of course. And I make sure that nobody tries to take more
water than their share, though I don't think we'll have any trouble.}
{1006}{}{I'm not feeling very well. Someone cracked my head with a big pipe. I went to the medic
but my head still hurts. Sure hope someone catches the jerk that hit me.}
{1007}{}{You too. I hope you find that chip soon so we can all go back to a normal life.}
{1008}{}{Well, they attacked me while I was here pretty late one night. Usually I go home by
eight or so, but I was staying late since someone had some water stolen and I was
checking our supplies. Next thing I know, I wake up in the med-lab with a big bump on my
head. Things are getting crazy around here. Someone is going to get killed for water
soon and I don't know what we can do about it.}
